/models
/examples
/tools/emb-eval/results.json

# The one ignored scratch directory: every gate log and throwaway probe goes
# here, and nothing here is ever committed. The repository root stays visible to
# git status on purpose — a stray log there must be noticed, not hidden.
/tmp/
/target/
__pycache__/

# The flows' own state: an in-flight marker, a run's record, the directories a
# finished run retires its record into, and the records some flows never track
# at all. A flow that wants its record in a commit forces it in, and
# the force stops being needed once the file is tracked — so ignoring these
# costs nothing and keeps a finished run out of the next run's status. A retired
# record stays on disk, readable, and out of every probe that globs for a live
# one.
/ai-docs/plans/.task-inflight
/ai-docs/plans/*.progress.md
/ai-docs/plans/ignored/
/ai-docs/main-ci/
/ai-docs/pr-comments/
/ai-docs/ci-fixes/
/ai-docs/dependabot/
/ai-docs/triage/**/*.progress.md
